3.3 SAP Asset Management workflow
Breakdown-to-completion workflow
1. Equipment breakdown reported
   
   Operator or supervisor reports the machine problem.
2. Maintenance notification
   
   Register equipment number, symptoms, location, HMR and priority.
3. Maintenance order
   
   Planner identifies labour, job steps, estimated hours, tools and spares.
4. Approval and release
   
   Check safety, material availability, budget and work permissions.
5. Maintenance execution
   
   Technician performs the job and records findings.
6. Spare issue and labour confirmation
   
   Actual material consumption and technician hours are entered.
7. Testing and handover
   
   Run the machine, verify function and close the job after acceptance.
8. Technical completion and cost settlement
   
   Record final cost, downtime, failure cause and corrective action.

