P&M MECHANICAL AND ELECTRICAL SAFETY













Construction Plant & Machinery – Mechanical and Electrical Safety Management
For an AGM / Head of Plant & Machinery, mechanical and electrical safety is one of the most important responsibilities. Your responsibility is not only to keep machinery operational but also to ensure that every machine, operator, mechanic, electrician, lifting operation and maintenance activity is safe.

The objective is:

Zero fatality • Zero major accident • Zero unsafe operation • Zero uncontrolled energy • Safe maintenance and commissioning.
